From: Fay <marius@gehrmann.solutions>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 00:38:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] LOCAL TEST ONLY: drm: asahi: t8122: Add an opt-in DPE
 leakage block

Not part of the series. The current14 GPU firmware on this J613 only
starts with the DPE leakage block that satchlj measured under macOS
(omacom/linux-aurora#26): asahi.t8122_dpe_leak=1 writes it. Carried here
so that the test kernel has a working GPU, as the daily kernel does.

